/ Only div, a, span and their class/href survive Action Text's sanitiser on the way out —
/ measured, not assumed. The facade is therefore plain markup that still works with
/ JavaScript off, and JournalHelper#activate_embed puts back the data attributes, the link
/ target and the aria-hidden the sanitiser strips.
.jn-embed
  a.jn-embed__facade href=block.url
    span.jn-embed__play ▶
    span.jn-embed__host= URI.parse(block.url).host
  - if block.embed_caption.present?
    .jn-embed__caption= block.embed_caption
